# Byte-exact checkouts on every platform: no line-ending conversion,
# ever. The repo is committed 100% LF and `zig fmt` requires LF, so a
# Windows checkout that CRLF-converts (autocrlf defaults vary by git
# install and runner image — it broke the Windows CI leg's
# `zig fmt --check` on 2026-08-16) must not happen. `-text` disables
# text detection and eol munging for all paths in both directions.
* -text
